  unitName: Hail Bot Reeze
  unitId: 20283
  unitNumber: 379
  description: A scientist from another world whose body is partly made up by a machine
    which releases cold air. She was developing a suit of armor that could boost
    its wearer's abilities when it went on a rampage, eventually taking her older
    brother's life. After being sucked into another world along with the armor she
    was rescued by a mage named Rashil. Uninterested in the mage who was after Cyborg
    Lilith, who happened to be her assistant in her home world, Reeze integrated
    machinery into her wounded body. She required the strength to destroy the armor
    that she had created.
  summonDesc: I am a wicked girl.<br>I've exploited the dead for<br>my own selfish
    reasons.
  fusionDesc: Nngh...<br>It's alright, it doesn't hurt...<br>Make me stronger...
